{"1240240": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Legendary Knight", "steam_appid": 1240240, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [1549770], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Defend your kingdom. Protect the sacred statues. Lead your knights to victory.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is invading your lands, and only the <strong>Legendary Knight</strong>, the king himself, can rally his forces to stand against them. As both ruler and commander, you must <strong>lead your army</strong>, <strong>fortify defenses</strong>, and <strong>push back relentless waves of invaders</strong> to safeguard your kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the king and command your forces in strategic real-time battles. Every decision matters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the statues</strong> that represent your kingdom’s ruling power</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight alongside your knights</strong> to repel endless enemy waves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage resources wisely</strong> to strengthen your army and upgrade your defenses</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build, Train &amp; Strategize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before each battle, carefully prepare for the enemy assault:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purchase powerful items</strong> to boost your combat strength</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train soldiers</strong> to improve their effectiveness in battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Assign generals and units</strong> to defend key buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn new skills</strong> using experience gained on the battlefield to enhance your king and troops</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Modes &amp; Content</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your challenge and test your strategies:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Mode</strong> → Includes <strong>3 unique maps</strong> with up to <strong>40 intense waves</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Mode</strong> → Survive as long as you can against an unstoppable horde</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 Playable Heroes</strong> → Each with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>+1 DLC Hero</strong> available for even greater variety</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Difficulty &amp; Replayability</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Victory won’t come easy — one mistake could cost you everything:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If the <strong>sacred statue</strong> is destroyed or the <strong>king falls</strong>, defeat is immediate</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master different heroes, upgrades, and strategies to adapt to tougher enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge yourself to survive longer, unlock new skills, and refine your tactics</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>&quot;Defend your kingdom. Protect the sacred statues. Lead your knights to victory.&quot;</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemy is invading your lands, and only the <strong>Legendary Knight</strong>, the king himself, can rally his forces to stand against them. As both ruler and commander, you must <strong>lead your army</strong>, <strong>fortify defenses</strong>, and <strong>push back relentless waves of invaders</strong> to safeguard your kingdom.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the king and command your forces in strategic real-time battles. Every decision matters:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defend the statues</strong> that represent your